 walks straight toward a patch of dry grass."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-M16_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Beluga","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"There's some shelter from the wind over here. Come."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"机场","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Fire_Bonfire","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_stage13","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"They find a clearing shielded by rocks. The four of them set down the box, light a fire, and huddle around it for warmth."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mityl","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We're finally safe."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mityl","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That was too close. They were fighting each other, so why did they suddenly focus on us?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's obvious—they're after the box."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"One group, then two... We've only been on the move for five hours, and we've already got a parade of rats on our trail."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_keyboardtype_sci","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Kuro furiously taps at her communicator."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No idea who's behind this. Radio silence."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Let's recap what's happened so far and make sense of our situation. This afternoon—"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-M16_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Beluga","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'll excuse myself."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Beluga interrupts the Commander."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Mityl snaps the branch she's been playing with. She jumps up and grabs Beluga's arm."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-M16_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":"Beluga","narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-M16_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Beluga","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"If I remember correctly, we only just met tonight?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mityl","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But you still saved my life!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mityl","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Taking a job, delivering a box—it's all just to make money, but making money is only a means to survive."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mityl","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So there's no need for you to make yourself scarce. The one who saved my life matters more than some anonymous client."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We're teammates now... right?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-M16_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Beluga","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-M16_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Stay. Like it or not, you're already involved."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-M16_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Besides, from what I can tell... I don't know a single thing about what's going on."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Beluga doesn't respond right away. Her gaze shifts across the three faces before her."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sincerity, candor, and trust... She closes her eyes."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-M16_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Beluga","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Alright."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"First, this afternoon in Marulos, we received a mission from an anonymous client. We were to depart at 1900 hrs and deliver this box to the Northridge Hotel within 24 hours."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Contents of the box—unknown; client—unknown."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander picks up a small stone and places it on the ground."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This represents the client."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Soon after that, we were attacked at the port by unidentified special forces. Their target was the box."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"They place another stone."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This represents the group at the port. I'll refer to them as special forces for now."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then on the boat, we noticed members of Doss' gang had boarded. Soon, the special forces caught up and started fighting Doss' men. But once they saw us, both sides targeted the box."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Doss is a third faction."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Three stones now form a triangle on the ground."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The client, unknown special forces, and Doss—they all want the box."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So what on earth is inside that box?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Everyone looks at the box."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It measures about 1.8 meters long, half a meter wide and high."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"There are two biometric locks, four convenient carrying handles, and two rows of ventilation holes on the side. Kuro peeks inside through one of the holes."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Can't see anything. It's blocked off..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mityl","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't like that client either, but she has a point—the more you know, the more danger you're in."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But danger's already found us. Staying in the dark just makes us more vulnerable."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mityl","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Not like we have much choice... We really can't open it."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_weapon_reload","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-M16_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Beluga","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't think it's wise to open it by force."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Beluga examines the locks and the box's structural seams carefully."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-M16_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Beluga","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"There's no way to break it open without damaging what's inside. You've got to unlock it properly."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We're already halfway to the hotel. If we find a car, then we can reach it by morning."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Whatever's in there, it's not our concern."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Mityl","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Want to come with us? ...Wait, no, it's too dangerous to travel with us."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mityl","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We'll come find you after we finish this job?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hey, maybe ask her if she even wants that. You do talk too much..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"Shake"}],"speaker":"Mityl","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Say that again?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"RunStep","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_23SF_Battle_1","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Mityl jumps up and goes after Kuro. Kuro quickly scrambles to her feet and runs."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The two whirl in circles around the fire, making everyone's head spin."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Can you two please stop?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then you stop her!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"RunStep","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Mityl strides over the Commander's outstretched legs, trying to take a shortcut. But the Commander is just getting up to intervene, and accidentally trips her. Mityl stumbles forward—straight into the fire pit."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Watch out!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_XXS_kick","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander reaches to catch her. Mityl instinctively grabs Kuro to right herself. In a blink, all three crash into a heap."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-M16_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":"Beluga","narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-M16_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Beluga","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Haha..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Beluga, the only one not caught in the chaos, burst out laughing at the comical scene."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mityl","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Haha... hahahaha..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Laughter spreads quickly, drowning out the chirping insects along the riverbank."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Hahaha... But Mityl's right. It really is too dangerous to travel with us."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-M16_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Beluga","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What place isn't dangerous?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Exactly. What place isn't? At least with us, you won't have to worry about getting dragged down by rookies or stabbed in the back by traitors."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mityl","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We're companions, after all."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Can we get up now?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":t